# score-evolution-journal

Long-horizon work journal for `feat/score-evolution`. Each entry is
written by a worker (sub-agent or human) when it finishes a task. The
parent reads this on resume to know what's been discovered.

Append-only. Format per entry:

```
## YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SSZ · task-id · status · worker

<one-paragraph summary>

<artifacts written>

<open questions / drift-tuning notes>
```

---

## 2026-09-04T16:00:00Z · PLAN · created · hermes

Plan written. Stage 1 (accumulator state) ready to start. 6 stages
total, ~4 days of focused work. Drift tuning flagged as the one
place that needs human eyes; everything else is mechanical.

Artifacts:
- .hermes/plans/score-evolution.md (the plan)
- .hermes/plans/score-evolution-state.json (machine-readable)
- .hermes/plans/score-evolution-journal.mdl (this file)
